>\\(\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"48306f486b6f0dda\" href=\"?note=48306f486b6f0dda\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-cumulative-stage.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-cumulative-stage.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}v\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S(A,\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}v\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S(A,\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\{x\\mid\\operatorname{rank}(x)&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(A=\\{x\\mid\\operatorname{rank}(x)&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span>, the set of hereditarily finite sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-cumulative-stage.md","status":"resolved","id":"48306f486b6f0dda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"",